1
00:00:00,693 --> 00:00:02,263
(Raj:)Oh, if it's even
the U.S. military.

2
00:00:02,261 --> 00:00:05,131
(Raj:)It could be foreign military
pretending to be American.

3
00:00:05,131 --> 00:00:07,531
(Howard:)You're right. We turn our
guidance system over to them,

4
00:00:07,533 --> 00:00:09,963
(Howard:)next thing we know,
they're using it against us.

5
00:00:11,738 --> 00:00:14,508
(Raj:)I also love the enemies
of America.

6
00:00:23,583 --> 00:00:26,613
(Beverly:)Penny, I hope the example
of my failed marriage

7
00:00:26,619 --> 00:00:29,019
(Beverly:)to Leonard's father
doesn't discourage you

8
00:00:29,021 --> 00:00:31,291
(Beverly:)from the commitment
you've made to one another.

9
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:34,460
Oh, of course not.

10
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:38,530
(Beverly:)Although Alfred and I had a lot
more going for us than you two.

11
00:00:40,099 --> 00:00:43,499
(Leonard:)Mom, please save something
for the toast.

12
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:50,640
(Mary:)So, Alfred, what is it
that you do for a living?

13
00:00:50,643 --> 00:00:51,913
(Alfred:)Oh, I'm an anthropologist.

14
00:00:51,911 --> 00:00:54,611
(Alfred:)I study ancient peoples
and cultures.

15
00:00:54,614 --> 00:00:56,614
(Mary:)My goodness, so all the way
back to the Flood.

16
00:00:56,616 --> 00:00:59,486
(laughing)

17
00:00:59,485 --> 00:01:01,985
(Sheldon:)Don't laugh...
she wasn't joking.

